// Parent namespace marker only: registers the "web" segment alias so dotted
// imports like `web.canvas`/`web.keys` can resolve and translate into other
// languages (e.g. `وب.بوم`/`وب.کلیدها`). No exports live here; see
// std/web/canvas and std/web/keys.
@en "web"
@fa "وب"
@ar "ويب"
package web
